  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>自定义准星模组</strong></h1>\n<h3><strong>Fabric、Forge 与 NeoForge</strong> | 26.2 | 26.1.2 | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.6 | 1.20.1 | 1.19 | 1.18.2 | 1.18.1 | 1.17.1 | 1.17 | 1.16.5 | 1.16.4 | 1.16.3 | 1.16.2 | 1.16.1 | 1.15.2 | 1.14.4 | 1.12 | 1.11.2 | 1.10 | 1.9.4 | 1.8.9/1.8.8 | 1.7.10</h3>\n<hr>\n<p>打造专属你的准星！终极准星定制工具。</p>\n<p><strong>默认按“GRAVE”键（反引号/波浪号键）打开定制菜单。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o1tyE5vJ/images/e78d93e10fd75f3575ca15368f2a6955c27988bb.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCustomCrosshairMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3e0a9ce1-7bd8-41f1-ace5-ed66a085a5c0.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>想要更多功能？试试新模组&hellip; <em><strong>实用准星 (Helpful Crosshair)</strong></em>：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/helpful-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7M5J9JvV/images/77f2b5b6e6cf8b9e58cea4ee9b4bc5f5b66c23f4.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcustomcrosshairmod.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">访问 🔗customcrosshairmod.com 了解更多详情！</a></p>\n<h2>你可以更改什么？</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>大小！</li>\n<li>颜色！</li>\n<li>彩虹准星！</li>\n<li>形状！</li>\n<li>动态变化！（试试使用弓或剑！）</li>\n<li>自适应颜色！</li>\n<li>支持服务器！</li>\n<li>自行绘制！</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>自定义绘制你的准星！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o1tyE5vJ/images/73aba3c4758c1eeeed3127f1d15de853e1f388f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>请考虑支持本模组！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=66431720\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EoTTpxb.png\" alt=\"成为赞助者！\"></strong></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/sazXJH7Bpv0\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>截图：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fdch7G\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Imgur 查看所有图片&hellip;</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QZGHHqU.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fdch7G\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ExEGCPL.png\" alt=\"井字准星\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fdch7G\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/mvDA3Eu.png\" alt=\"自定义准星\"></a></p>",
